+---
+id: task-003-validate-task-input
+type: task
+title: "Validate task input"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Request
+
+Reject invalid input with a clear error when a task is added, renamed or tagged: a title that is empty or
+only spaces; a title longer than 120 characters; a priority other than `low`, `normal` and `high`; a tag
+that is empty or contains a space. A rejected input changes nothing in the list.
+
+## Done
+
+New error code `invalid-input` (returned as a `Result`, rule r4). Validators in `src/domain/task.ts`
+(`validateTitle`, `validatePriority`, `validateTag`, `validateNewTask`) run before anything is stored or an
+id is issued, in `add`, `rename` and `tag`. The title limit counts the trimmed title and is exported as
+`MAX_TITLE_LENGTH`. Tests in `test/list.test.ts`; documented in `README.md`.
